            "text_hk6MXP": {
              "type": "text",
              "name": "t:names.text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Maybe you've been searching. Maybe you've been silent. But your inner frequency has been calling for alignment - and the universe listened.<br/><br/>At<strong> </strong>Tat Sat, we don't just offer crystals. We offer Divine Companions - each one coded with light, sound, and intention to support your highest path. <br/><br/>If you feel a quiet YES in your body, if your eyes pause a little longer on one crystal, if your heart knows before your mind catches up, that’s your karmic awakening whispering:<br/><strong><br/>\"You’re ready to remember who you are.\"<br/></strong><br/>Every piece you see here has been chosen, coded and prepared through sacred rituals - so it may reach the one it was meant for. You did not find us. You remembered us. You were never lost - only being led, gently, back to your truth.</p>",
                "width": "fit-content",
                "max_width": "none",
                "alignment": "left",
                "type_preset": "rte",
                "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                "font_size": "1rem",
